WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.300
In Review & Export, choose Export.

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:02.300
Choose PDF, then export the document.

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:04.500
Choose a file name and save the PDF.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:06.800
In File exported, choose Share.

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:08.300
Windows Share opens. Choose Outlook to start an email.

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:11.870
Outlook opens a new draft with the exported PDF attached.
